  <!--磁轨重武器（质量）-->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>GR_RailCannon</defName>
    <label>Neutron star</label>
    <description>A heavy weapon built in an era before the Gray existed, converted by a group of fanatical heavy-firepower enthusiasts from a decommissioned frigate's secondary gun. Its staggering recoil is difficult even for enhanced soldiers in exoskeletons to handle, so it was handed over to the Gray to deal with the giant creatures encountered during colonial expansion. Using an extended high-pressure rail and a heavy capacitor, it fires armor-piercing high-explosive rounds of tremendous mass; its power is enough to level a small building or reduce a 22nd-century main battle tank to scrap.</description>
